<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 16.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 16.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 16	     April 15</p>
<p>Fed acct			17.884		  9.607</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  34.001		 24.872</p>
<p>Cash balance		  51.885		 34.479</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,299.758	     5,296.755</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $4 million were issued and $74 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
